  "verification_requirements": [
    "Before adoption, verify the project revision, exact before bytes, absent new helper, unchanged existing 0001 postimage, and patch hash; replay without fuzz and verify both after files.",
    "Run the pinned native Kati on an isolated fixture and the actual product with explicit capability and environment BUILD_DATETIME; bind interpreter identity and its actual child environment.",
